{
  "description": "Audited original Capcom SFII artwork; exact pixels, no redrawing or AI generation. Sources acquired through normal browser downloadMedia on 2026-10-20.",
  "rights": "Original game artwork belongs to Capcom. Spriters Resource hosts community rips; no redistribution license is asserted. Preserve source and contributor attribution.",
  "edition": "Champion Edition menu logo, select and versus art. HUD sheet is SFII collection art and is not labeled CE-specific.",
  "rawSourceDirectory": "assets/source/arcade-ui",
  "sourceExclusion": "Exclude assets/source/** from runtime bundles and asset groups.",
  "limitations": [
    "The Title sheet (180851) is the World Warrior opening city/intro artwork, not a Champion Edition title backdrop; audited and retained only as source, not cropped into runtime UI.",
    "Defeated portraits are the first injured variant on the CE portrait sheet; a normal portrait can serve winner/results artwork.",
    "world-map contains original blue map background and no baked roster; two-fighter selector must be built separately.",
    "Bitmap font and HUD glyph crops are sprites, not a TTF; accessible/dynamic text may retain the existing readable font.",
    "Source sheets contain multiple variants and contributor edits; runtime crops use the normal CE Ryu/Ken portraits and original CE emblem/logo only."
  ],
